Package: pida
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-venv, curl
Suggests: systemd-sysv
Maintainer: PiDA <local@invalid>
Description: Pi Action API — schema-driven device dispatch server
 A Flask/gunicorn service that turns a declarative YAML file into an
 HTTP device API: every action becomes POST /api/<group>/<action>,
 parameterized actions expose a typed schema (/api/schema) consumed by
 the PiDA Android companion (tiles + home-screen widgets). Run strings
 are plain bash; per-install device data (pida.yaml, icons/,
 library/) lives in the user's home and is never managed by this
 package. Installed as the pi-api.service systemd unit.
